          automatics: [ { name: "5-Speed Automatic (ZF 5HP18)", torqueLimit: "300 Nm", oilType: "ZF Lifeguard 5", note: "The incredibly smooth, relaxed ZF 5-speed. It matches the linear power delivery of the M60 perfectly for luxury cruising. However, old degraded ATF fluid will eventually destroy the fragile internal clutch packs and the reverse gear drum." } ]
