          automatics: [ { name: "5-Speed Automatic (ZF 5HP24)", torqueLimit: "350 Nm", oilType: "ZF Lifeguard 5", note: "The incredibly smooth, relaxed ZF 5-speed. It matches the linear power delivery of the M62 perfectly for luxury cruising. However, old degraded ATF fluid will eventually destroy the fragile internal clutch packs and the notorious reverse gear drum." } ]
