          automatics: [ { name: "8-Speed Automatic (ZF 8HP70)", torqueLimit: "700 Nm", oilType: "ZF Lifeguard 8", note: "A massive upgrade for the LCI F01. The ZF 8-speed is phenomenally fast, smooth, and highly reliable. It handles the 560Nm stock torque perfectly, maximizing fuel economy and acceleration. An xHP transmission flash is highly recommended if tuned." } ]
