          automatics: [ { name: "8-Speed Automatic with Integrated 48V Motor (ZF 8HP76)", torqueLimit: "800 Nm", oilType: "ZF Lifeguard 8", note: "The absolute pinnacle of ZF engineering. It seamlessly integrates a 48V electric motor directly inside the bellhousing. It manages the brutal 750Nm torque flawlessly. Fluid flushes are absolutely vital." } ]
